;
CLS - CLEAR THE TERMINAL DISPLAY

A - Clear the terminal display

:A
CLEAR THE TERMINAL DISPLAY

    CLS

Clears the terminal screen. Use it when you want a clean command display.
It does not erase files, alter the current DU or end your call.

Use an ANSI/VT100-compatible terminal for the supplied screen-oriented
programs. If the display remains garbled, check your terminal settings.

See HELP READING.
